e":"神月 社","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:89778","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"ayachi","creatorId":"vndb:s4154","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4154","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4154","name":"ayachi","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:89779","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"タケイオーキ","creatorId":"vndb:s4173","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4173","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4173","name":"タケイオーキ","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:89780","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"sue","creatorId":"vndb:s4174","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4174","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4174","name":"sue","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:89782","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"kousui","creatorId":"vndb:s4177","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4177","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4177","name":"kousui","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:89785","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"東山 奈央","creatorId":"vndb:s5716","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5716","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5716","name":"東山 奈央","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:89787","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"小島 紗","creatorId":"vndb:s46104","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s46104","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s46104","name":"小島 紗","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:89790","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17967","characterName":"高幡 ちはる","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17967"},"originalCharacterName":"高幡 ちはる","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"D"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chiharu is a second-year student and the new president of the student council. She is also Yumi's best friend, who is her classmate just like Ichio and Seiji. Serious at first sight, she is actually quite clumsy and puffy. She always smiles and is always kind to everyone, even to the \"problem childrens\" (Ichio and Ayano) to Yumi's greatest despair, who often finds her asleep in the boardroom."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She takes advice from Tomoko-senpai, who is the former president of the student council, and they have decided to ask Ichio for help in preparing the school's Christmas party together, choosing the school's former chapel as the \"operations centre\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chiharu quickly loses control of her emotions when her embarrassment is at its peak and she has developed the habit of locking herself in the lockers at these times to regain her senses."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a great lover of amusement parks and despite her great shyness, she knows how to take the lead when she absolutely wants to get something."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17967"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4a/4a906102ca8d2834c7f60c0f2152101de4627fd074ad2792dc0f16eeb5c2016c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f7/f7f2555404e0f58b9bd3c4a56cbe4c00974baebd75e3c743451e118bd625ea68.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"森野 まりあ","creatorId":"vndb:s810","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s810","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s810","name":"内田 愛美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:47694","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17968","characterName":"長津田 夕美","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17968"},"originalCharacterName":"長津田 夕美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"E"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yumi is Chiharu's best friend and classmate as well as Ichio and Seiji. In the top of the best students in the class, Yumi is a very smart girl. Very close to Chiharu, she became extremely worried for her when she learned that Tomoko-senpai had chosen Ichio \"the naked man\" as a volunteer to help her prepare for the Christmas party. As a good friend, she joins Ichio so that she can keep an eye on him and he doesn't attack his friend Chiharu."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, while they were cleaning the old school chapel to serve as their operating room, Yumi got her feet tangled and a pile of cardboard began to fall on her when heroically, Ichio used his body as a shield to protect the young girl's beauty. Touched by his chivalrous action, Yumi decided to join the group as a volunteer in order to pay her debt."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yumi is a cold girl, who doesn't show her emotions as easily as other people. However, she has an S side that expresses itself willingly when it comes to annoying her friends."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the first girl to show more than friendly interest in Ichio."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"-------"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the class representative in her second year, with a calm and gentle appearance. Her words and actions are characterized by an extremely relaxed and leisurely pace, with each action not being particularly quick. However, this doesn't mean she's slow, and her movements are normal in speed. She has a clear distinction between moments of stillness and moments of movement."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She may seem indifferent to her surroundings, but she has a good understanding of them and moves at her own pace while avoiding anything that may hinder her. She secretly moves to a position where she won't be disturbed."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her appearance as a gentle and refined lady has made her popular among her classmates, with her popularity being on par with that of the student council president. She has excellent grades, especially in math. As the treasurer of the Christmas committee, she holds the purse strings and is a formidable opponent who won't give in to the protagonist's demands easily. She enjoys puzzle games and detective novels that require critical thinking."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17968"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/05/054521a0e24386694dc4fa6cd857bd3eb613f5c19dc1d216a89da3eb37b5254f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cd/cd7017cdf1e19899f48c5488b912fadf23cb57b80ff38c5443a56cae04c0416f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"あじ 秋刀魚","creatorId":"vndb:s11","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11","name":"前田 恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:47691","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17969","characterName":"梶矢 彩乃","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17969"},"originalCharacterName":"梶矢 彩乃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"91"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"F"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"164"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ayano is a third-year student and a friend of Tomoko. She has been Ichio's best friend since kindergarten and she treats him and considers him as her little brother, making their relationship a little ambiguous in the eyes of others, taking him by the neck and really being close to him (physically). However, neither she nor he sees the other as actually a member of the opposite sex."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Having an extraordinary personality, Ayano is appreciated by everyone in the school. However, no one sees or treats her as a girl because of her extraordinary personality. In fact, she is quite similar to Ichio but in worse because she has no embarrassment with the girls, which allows her to tease her friends a lot. When Ayano learns that Ichio is surrounded by pretty girls with whom he is preparing the Christmas party, she decides to join the group as a volunteer to help them, supposedly because \"things might get fun\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"For some time now, Ayano has been getting closer to Seiji because they have Ichio as a common friend, which has given birth to rumours about them saying that they are dating, which is completely false and impossible."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a great food lover, especially of ramen, a passion she shares with Ichio. She'd eat tons of it if her money would allow her to."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Ayano has almost no weaknesses, except for one. Never being treated like a girl by others, she is very sensitive to everything that can be complimented by positively touching her femininity, making her very nervous, embarrassed and happy (especially when it is Ichio who does it). She is particularly embarrassed when Ichio delights himself in the smell she has deposited in the blankets in which she sleeps, calling him a pervert."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She knows the entire erotic collection of Ichio, including his AVs, mangas and computer content as well as his preferences for \"onee-san\" type girls."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is apparently a masturbation practitioner, \"with the same frequency of use as Ichio\"."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17969"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1f8ee8d5c72850563ddf97d6153ecc8ffc8e43d1251fdfddbf4220217370e0dd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2f/2ff220d8de8b36babc9ca4b1e8d11bc251504b011618a00f109e807f1a8689e7.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"かわしま りの","creatorId":"vndb:s28","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28","name":"瑞沢 渓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:47692","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17970","characterName":"宮前 エリ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17970"},"originalCharacterName":"宮前 エリ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"B"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"154"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"81"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"54"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Eri is a first-year student, and also the first victim of the terrible \"Zenra Otoko\". She is a member of the disciplinary committee, she takes her role very seriously and gives herself body and soul to ensuring that good morals are respected in her school. She is a very direct girl, who dares to assert her ideas and defends the innocent, while being kind and adorable, making her quite popular in school. She is also a volunteer girl who performs all the tasks assigned to her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"With her role, she maintains cordial relations with the new president of the student council, Chiharu, and when she learns that Ichio will help Chiharu with other girls, Eri decides, in the name of morality, to join the group of students preparing the Christmas party during her free time and as a volunteer."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Eri is a very nice girl and she decides to listen to Chiharu about Ichio in order to give him a second chance to make up for his past fault. Over time, Ichio became the only person she referred to with Senpai's only term, showing him that she somehow appreciated him more than before."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Eri is a very innocent girl and does not understand Ayano-senpai's perverse allusions, until someone says them in a clearer way. However, she is very receptive to her Senpai's remarks, whether they are perverse or not."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17970"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9b/9b213ef03e8ad564668308d0e4a4cbb3d42f1aa2b3bec9881f2601810d5871d5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3dfc619f4295d8f83c764fdfc128d7164bbc1eb8f0dc6ecbef0d2ec41d211683.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"香山 いちご","creatorId":"vndb:s809","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s809","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s809","name":"山口 絵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:47693","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c64264","characterName":"江田 市生","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c64264"},"originalCharacterName":"江田 市生","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ichio is the protagonist of the game. He is Ayano-neesan's childhood friend, a third year who has been his friend since kindergarten."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ichio is a second-year student, with a very good head and a bad reputation, he is in the same class as Seiji, one of his only friends. Why does Ichio have such a bad reputation?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Well, one day during a cleaning chore, Ichio spilled the solvent filled bucket on him. Soaked, Ichio decided to take off his clothes and change them with dry clothes. Except that Ichio took off his soaked clothes in the hallway and his dry clothes were in his classroom, locked. To make matters worse, it was at this point that a young member of the disciplinary committee, Eri, found him in his underpants in the hallway. Panicked, Eri ran away screaming: \"The Naked Pervert Exhibitionist Man\" while Ichio was running after her, telling that it was a misunderstanding."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It is with this sad reputation that one day Ichio is called by Tomoko-senpai to the office of the new president of the student council, Chiharu, to help her with Yumi, their classmate, to prepare (as a volunteer) the Christmas party for the students..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a great food lover, especially of ramen, a passion he shares with Ayano-neesan. He'd eat tons of it if his money would allow him to."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64264"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/49/4998b583844aa34f7ce1c33cbabc3c956690518bd8b95a131cb314efda95df3c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4a/4a20bc5c44529063304d96643b79be6910f1ce2a6955acd2d050d5c0a34baf41.webp","width":191,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c64265","characterName":"月見 若菜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c64265"},"originalCharacterName":"月見 若菜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"89"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"E"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ec/ec05f71364d13f6876bcde05017b027a95380fe9d26272da007b33a3021daafd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0c17edaff1331be0d6c3052a4ee914717362d9b33f72dbcd2ab1aa599fbabd6b.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"伊藤 かな恵","creatorId":"vndb:s853","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s853","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s853","name":"伊藤かな恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:47696","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c64266","characterName":"渋谷 みつば","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c64266"},"originalCharacterName":"渋谷 みつば","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"90"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"G"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"151"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0eca507c05c5bbf6eee1720217366e049756834808a2d8d46c41bb12805b8c3b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/793ec1dc5825ef0fb79c92d14920ce48f13ea7e7c5c65ab7ca1179f409406c36.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"東山 奈央","creatorId":"vndb:s5716","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5716","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5716","name":"東山 奈央","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:47699","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c64267","characterName":"溝口 朋子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c64267"},"originalCharacterName":"溝口 朋子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tomoko is a third-year student and former president of the student council. She is also the one who prepared the old Christmas party with the help of her best friend, Ayano. She is a girl who listens to others and is ready to do all the services in the world to make people happy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is one of the only people from whom Ayano comes to ask for advice of any kind or to provide services such as integrating Ichio into the group of volunteers formed by Chiharu for preparing the Christmas party (so that he can have some good memories of his schooling), which shows how highly Ayano considered her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is also one of the only people to tease Ayano about her non-existent femininity and she often jokes with Ichio about it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she is very busy, she comes as soon as she can to help them prepare for the party."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64267"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/18/180870ed88294bc7fff11a958da774d3adab293c4f624d183fa191bc99dfdde4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c4/c46f6c6c576fbb89e42c28dc972abb8c02c51be832f1d1b012f18cd9f29b6a7f.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桜 ちとせ","creatorId":"vndb:s600","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s600","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s600","name":"志水 結美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:47697","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c64268","characterName":"堀之内 清詞","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c64268"},"originalCharacterName":"堀之内 清詞","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Seiji is a second-year student and Ichio's friend and classmate of Chiharu and Yumi. He is one of the only ones to hang out with Ichio before he was contacted by Tomoko-senpai and it was while hanging out with him in the ramen restaurants that he met Ayano-neesan. It was from that moment that he realized that beings resembling women existed on Earth and that Ayano was one of them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When Ichio joined the volunteer group, Seiji decided to come and help them because \"two men are better than one\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"There's been a rumor going around for some time that he would go out with Ayano, which is completely false and impossible."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64268"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4b/4b808202ca6c57ebddbf47adfbe0d7efda85b6653bebfe21a88ec520cee35e07.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ef/efed21d18c675d1867f14b79016ed457b2828fa48d015b72b835494007eb82d7.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"野々村 紗夜","creatorId":"vndb:s839","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s839","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s839","name":"佐倉 ゆき","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:47695","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c64269","characterName":"黒洲 満良","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c64269"},"originalCharacterName":"黒洲 満良","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mitsuyoshi is the principal of the school and the kind grandfather appreciated by all the students. Always smiling and kind to the students, he has been playing Santa Claus for years, a role that suits him very well."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64269"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6f/6f55e764f848b4075cca2af8ed5863f9bbe7538a05212088931b9f6a76945fd6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images